#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will forgo this step since the goal of this experiment is to measure the lifetime of a logical qubit under real hardware noise, such as amplitude damping during the idle delays; a noiseless simulator would show no errors to detect and correct.\n"
msgstr "Lalaktawan natin ang hakbang na ito dahil ang layunin ng eksperimentong ito ay sukatin ang lifetime ng logical qubit sa ilalim ng aktwal na hardware noise, tulad ng amplitude damping sa panahon ng idle delays; ang isang noiseless na simulator ay hindi magpapakita ng anumang error na madedetect at maitatama.\n"

